Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:49.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真好 - 我知道你已经有鼠弟的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:51.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you could wear Bullwinkle and Bullwinkle...
