Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna get another espresso. More latte?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还要一杯义式浓缩咖啡 你还要拿铁吗？
