Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:12.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm still working on mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:12.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我还在努力的喝这一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it was really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很困难 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:22.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, the hug looked pretty brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:22.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个拥抱感觉很残酷 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:23.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:23.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又不在场
