Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:47.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me! I was kind of using that machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:47.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思！我在用这部机器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:50.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, now you're kind of not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，嗯，现在你好像没在用了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:54.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I saved it. I put my basket on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:54.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我已经有保留 我把篮子放在上面了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:57.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm sorry. Is that your basket? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:57.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真对不起，这是你的篮子？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:11:00.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's really pretty. Unfortunately, I don't see suds!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:11:00.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很漂亮 可惜的是，我没看到洗衣粉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:04.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:04.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No suds, no save, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有洗衣粉就不能保留，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:12.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's going on? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:12.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么事？ - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:16.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. This horrible woman just took my machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:16.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么，那个讨厌的女人 抢了我的洗衣机
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:18.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was your basket on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:18.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的篮子有放在上面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, but there were no suds. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有，不过没放洗衣粉 - 那又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, no suds, no save.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是…没洗衣粉就不算保留
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No suds, no... Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没洗衣粉就不…不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下！
