Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我朋友的洗衣机
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, hey, hey! Her stuff wasn't in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，嘿，嘿! 她的东西没放在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, hey, hey! That's not the rule, and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，嘿，嘿! 你明知规矩不是那样的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:47.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:47.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，戏演完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing to see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么好看的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Let's do laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我们开始洗衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was amazing! I can't even send back soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太厉害了！ 我连不是我点的汤都不敢退还
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:06.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's because you're such a sweet, gentle...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:06.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是因为你是如此甜美、温柔…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:09.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you, uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:09.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有…？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey. You must need detergent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，嘿，你一定需要洗衣粉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.55,0:12:18.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's that? - Überweiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.55,0:12:18.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那是什么？ - 超白牌洗衣粉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's new. It's German. It's extra tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是新的，德国货 超强力！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, do you...? Are you gonna separate those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，你这些要分开吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:33.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Am I being like a total laundry spaz?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:33.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很洗衣白痴，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:37.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Am I supposed to use one machine for shirts and another for pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:37.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是否该把上衣跟裤子 分别放入不同的洗衣机？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:43.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you...? Have you never done this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:43.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从来没洗过衣服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, not myself. But I know other people that have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，我是没有啦 可是我认识一些洗过衣服的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. You caught me. I'm a laundry virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，被你逮到了 我是个洗衣处女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry. I'll use the gentle cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要害怕 我会慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:05.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Basically, you wanna use one machine for all your whites.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:05.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基本上，你得把所有白色的 放在一部机器里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whites. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白色的，好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- A whole other machine for your colors. - Colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有颜色的放入另一部 - 有颜色的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then a third for your, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还要第三部洗你的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...delicates. And that would be your bras...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贴身衣物 也就是你的胸罩…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and your underpanty things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的小内裤之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, these are white cotton panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些是白色的棉质内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:27.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would they go with whites or with delicates?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:27.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是要跟白色的衣物放一起 还是跟贴身衣物呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That would be a judgment call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这得靠你自由心证了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:37.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:37.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:41.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So where did you guys grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:41.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在哪里长大的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Brooklyn Heights. - Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 布鲁克林高地 - 克里夫兰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:44.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha. Heh, heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:44.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈 呵呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:46.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How did that happen? - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:46.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么会这样？ - 我的天！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suddenly had the feeling I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我突然有一种…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.77,0:13:53.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.77,0:13:53.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}往下掉的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:55.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:55.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you and Angela, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟安琪拉在一起，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:10.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep. Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:10.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're a lucky man. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你是个幸运的男人 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what I miss the most about her?
