Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:51.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真的？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:55.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm thinking, if we put our heads together, between the two of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:55.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们团结起来 就凭我们二人…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:57.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we can break them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:57.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定可以拆散他们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: I'm so sorry. I can't believe I did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 真不敢相信我会出这种差错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:06.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just couldn't stop laughing at your Norman Mailer story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:06.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你那个作家诺曼梅勒的故事 让我笑到不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:15.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Waiter? One more plate of chicken wings over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:15.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}服务生？我们还要一盘鸡翅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's the thing. It's like we're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像这样 我们根本不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:26.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm the bing, you're the boom...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:26.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是那种乒乒乒的人 你则是砰砰砰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:28.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JANICE: Ow! - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:28.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦 噢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:29.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, my God!  - Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:29.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 哦，我的天！ - 噢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:30.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm so sorry! - Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:30.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我很抱歉！ - 噢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Are you okay? - Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:36.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just my lens. It's my lens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:36.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是我的隐形眼镜 我的镜片跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hit her in the eye! I hit her in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打中她的眼睛！ 打中她的眼睛！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the worst breakup in the history of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:46.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是史上最差劲的分手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦，我的天！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:52.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How many of those have you had?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:52.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底喝了几杯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. A million!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不晓得，一百万杯吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, shh, shh. Easy, easy. Go to your happy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，放轻松，放轻松 想想你快乐的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:01.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:01.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啦-啦-啦-啦-啦-啦-啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm fine, I'm fine. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我很好，我很好 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:06.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not fine. Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:06.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不好，她来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:08.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait here, okay? Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:08.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这里等好吗？呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:29.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:29.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么办到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像一种天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should always, always break up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以后我们一定要一起分手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:43.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: You got the clothes clean. That's the important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:43.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}衣服干净了 这才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess. Except everything looks like jammies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想也是 可惜现在全部看起来都像睡衣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:53.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:53.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.07,0:20:56.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. We had this cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.07,0:20:56.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，这推车是我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.28,0:20:59.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had a 24-inch waist. You lose things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.28,0:20:59.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的腰以前也只有二十四寸 人生总是有得有失
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, come on. Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了，别挡我的路
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:06.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Maybe I wasn't being clear. This was our cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:06.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起，也许我没有说清楚 这推车是我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:08.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, hey, hey. There aren't any clothes in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:08.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，嘿，嘿! 刚才又没有衣服在推车里！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:11.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, hey, hey! Quit making up rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:11.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿 不要乱订规则！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:15.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let go! Come on, this is my cart. You know I saw it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:15.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放手！快，这是我的推车 你知道是我先看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:17.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, Mitzi, if you want this cart...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:17.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我听好，女人 如果你要这推车…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:20.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're gonna have to take me with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:20.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就连我一起推走！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes! Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赞！你看到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:30.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:30.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:33.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A brand-new woman, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:33.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位先生、各位女士 看看这位全新的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:36.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could not have done this without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:36.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢，没有你的话 我根本办不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:43.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Okay, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:43.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:46.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh... More clothes in the dryer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:46.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干衣机里还有衣服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:51.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm fine. I'm fine. - Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:51.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我没事，没事 - 你确定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Are you sure you're okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你确定你没事？ - 确定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:59.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Does it still hurt? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:59.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还会痛吗？ - 会
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:06.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a neat idea. All your clothes match. I'm gonna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:06.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好主意！你所有的衣服都同色了 我也要这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.89,0:22:08.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.89,0:22:08.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:10.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:10.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还顺利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.35,0:22:11.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.35,0:22:11.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:15.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We ripped that couple apart and kept the pieces for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:15.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们把那一对拆开了 然后各自保留一半
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.15,0:22:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a beautiful story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.15,0:22:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好浪漫的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.99,0:22:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.99,0:22:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了，我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:23.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:23.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Where's Chandler? - He needed some time to grieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 钱德呢？ - 他需要一点疗伤的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:29.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: I'm free! I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:29.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我自由了！我自由了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.83,0:22:33.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.83,0:22:33.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该是复原了
